# MediFlow Pro — Implementation Plan

## Phase 1: Foundation
1. Update `pubspec.yaml` with all dependencies
2. Create folder structure (core/, features/, shared/, services/, routes/)
3. Set up theme system (Material 3, dark/light modes)
4. Set up localization (AR/EN)
5. Create app entry point with Riverpod

## Phase 2: Core Architecture
1. Models (User, Appointment, Doctor, Patient, Prescription, Invoice)
2. Services (Auth, Firestore, Storage, Notifications)
3. Providers (Riverpod state management)
4. Router (GoRouter with role-based guards)

## Phase 3: Features
### Auth
- Splash → Onboarding → Login/Register → Role Router

### Patient
- Dashboard, Book Appointment, Doctors List, Medical History, Prescriptions, Profile

### Doctor
- Dashboard, Schedule, Patient Records, Add Prescription, Availability

### Admin
- Analytics Dashboard, Manage Doctors/Patients, Appointments, Billing, Revenue

## Phase 4: Shared Components
- Reusable widgets, animations, form validators, PDF generation

## Phase 5: Polish
- Demo data seeding, README, Firebase guide
